  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows the variation with time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> of the net force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acting on an object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\\text{ kg}\"></span>. The object is initially at rest.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the object when <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 20\\text{ ms}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
